  "releaseNotes": "2.5.2 updates the sole direct runtime dependency to Icod.Terminal 1.29.2. System-backed Windows sessions now retain UTF-8 box-drawing cell geometry, own mouse delivery in Raw and CBreak modes while suppressing Quick Edit, and restore the exact prior console state. No DCurses public API or AssemblyVersion change. Release notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.DCurses/blob/main/docs/releases/2.5.2.md.",
